cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research instrument, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Auracelle Charlie: A Wargaming Simulation Instrument for AI Governance Policy Optimisation"
abstract: >
  Auracelle Charlie is a browser-based wargaming simulation platform developed 
  as a doctoral research instrument at Bath Spa University. It operationalises 
  the Evans Accelerated Governance Policy Optimisation — Hierarchical Theory 
  (E-AGPO-HT v3.1) framework to test AI governance policy outcomes through 
  structured multi-actor simulation, multi-agent reinforcement learning, and 
  adversarial stress-testing with MITRE ATT&CK integration.
